{
  "title": "Reader blinking amber",
  "question": "A card reader has been blinking amber for a long time. Can the merchant unplug it?",
  "body": "Blinking amber means a firmware update is running. Do not turn the reader off: it finishes on its own. If the update fails, the reader shows K-310; keep it charging and retry from Settings, Hardware."
